  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>By family of circle,&nbsp;circle passing through intersection of given circles will be member of</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#955;S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>&#160;family&#160;</mtext><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#160;Centre&#160;</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Centre lies on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now circle is:<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now check each option</p>",
